  "title": { "zh": "背包表", "en": "Knapsack table" },
  "short": { "zh": "会伸缩的来路", "en": "A reach that stretches" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "把装包也做成表。行是物品，列是背包容量 0、1、2……格子 (第 i 行, 容量 w) 记着：<b>只从前 i 件物品里挑、背包容量是 w 时，最多能装多少价值</b>。",
        "en": "Turn packing into a table too. Rows are items and columns are backpack capacities 0, 1, 2… Cell (row i, capacity w) records: <b>the most value you can pack choosing only from the first i items, with a backpack of capacity w</b>."
      },
