    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "只看最后一件：第 i 件物品，要么<b>不拿</b>，要么<b>拿</b>。不拿的话，答案和正上方那一格一样。",
        "en": "Look only at the last item: item i is either <b>left out</b> or <b>taken</b>. If it is left out, the answer is the same as the cell right above."
      },
      "fig": {
        "scene": {
