      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "拿的话呢？背包得先给它腾出空间。想一想：腾出空间<b>之前</b>，背包是表里的哪一格？拿上它以后又多了什么？最后，拿和不拿，你要的是哪一个？",
        "en": "And if it is taken? The backpack first has to make room for it. Think: <b>before</b> making room, which cell of the table is the backpack? What do you gain by taking the item? And in the end, between taking and leaving it, which do you want?"
      },
      "fig": {
        "scene": {
          "cells": [
            { "id": "ax0", "x": 0, "y": -38, "w": 44, "h": 26, "value": 0, "cls": "axis" },
