    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "这一关的机器人「长臂」站在 (第 i 行, 容量 w) 上。正上方的格子在视野里就能看到；可往左「重量」格可能很远，视野装不下。又要用到青蛙过河时的<wiki-ref to=\"arms\"></wiki-ref>：这次它伸到往左「这件物品的重量」格，上一行、本行各读一格；点它够到的格子，「视野」元件上就多一个输出口。「本格信息」里是这件物品的「物品价值」。",
        "en": "This level’s robot, Longarm, stands on (row i, capacity w). The cell right above is in its view, but the cell as many columns to the left as the item weighs may be far away, out of view. The <wiki-ref to=\"arms\"></wiki-ref> from the frog’s river comes in again: this time it reaches left by “this item’s weight” cells and reads one cell on the row above and one on this row; click a cell it reaches, and the “View” part gains an output for it. The This cell panel holds this item’s “item value”."
      }
    }
  ],
  "mission": {
    "goal": {
      "zh": "总重量不能超过容量，每件物品最多拿一次。拼出背包表的电路，算出每个背包最多能装多少价值。",
      "en": "The total weight can’t exceed the capacity, and each item can be taken at most once. Build the knapsack table’s circuit and work out the most value each backpack can hold."
    },
    "how": {
      "zh": "前两个测试，就是你在<level-ref to=\"pack\"></level-ref>里亲手装过的背包。通过后，绿色格子是倒推出的装法。",
      "en": "The first two tests are the backpacks you packed by hand in <level-ref to=\"pack\"></level-ref>. Once you pass, the green cells show the packing traced back from the table."
    }
  },
  "robot": "reach",
  "unlock": "choose",
  "builds": {
    "ports": [
      { "named": { "label": { "zh": "不换", "en": "keep" }, "short": "a", "sensor": "up" } },
      { "named": { "label": { "zh": "换来", "en": "swap for" }, "short": "b", "sensor": "upk" } },
      { "named": { "label": { "zh": "加上", "en": "plus" }, "short": "+", "sensor": "value" } }
    ]
  },
  "diagnose": [
    {
      "when": { "uses": "rowk" },
      "say": {
        "zh": "同一行的格子已经考虑过这件物品了，从那里再拿，就把它拿了两次。要拿这件，得从上一行腾地方。",
        "en": "Cells on the same row have already considered this item, so taking it again from there takes it twice. To take this item, make room on the row above."
      }
    }
  ],
  "trace": "knap",
  "after": "knap",
  "boardOpt": { "minScale": 0.68, "maxScale": 1.15 },
  "hints": [
    {
      "zh": "每件物品都可以不拿：不拿的话，答案就是「正上方」。",
      "en": "Any item can be left out: then the answer is just “right above”."
    },
    {
      "zh": "拿这件物品：先在上一行腾出它的重量，再加上它的价值。两种选择接进「取较大」汇合器。",
      "en": "Taking this item: make room for its weight on the row above, then add its value. Wire both choices into a “max” Merger."
    }
  ],
  "world": "knap",
  "facts": ["value"],
  "tests": [
    {
      "W": 5,
      "items": [
        { "n": { "zh": "帐篷", "en": "tent" }, "w": 4, "v": 5 },
        { "n": { "zh": "相机", "en": "camera" }, "w": 2, "v": 3 },
        { "n": { "zh": "水壶", "en": "bottle" }, "w": 3, "v": 4 },
        { "n": { "zh": "零食", "en": "snacks" }, "w": 1, "v": 1 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "W": 10,
      "items": [
        { "n": { "zh": "睡袋", "en": "sleeping bag" }, "w": 6, "v": 30 },
        { "n": { "zh": "炉具", "en": "stove" }, "w": 3, "v": 14 },
        { "n": { "zh": "帐篷", "en": "tent" }, "w": 4, "v": 16 },
        { "n": { "zh": "急救包", "en": "first aid kit" }, "w": 2, "v": 9 },
        { "n": { "zh": "书", "en": "book" }, "w": 1, "v": 1 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "W": 7,
      "items": [
        { "n": { "zh": "相机", "en": "camera" }, "w": 3, "v": 4 },
        { "n": { "zh": "水壶", "en": "bottle" }, "w": 4, "v": 5 },
        { "n": { "zh": "零食", "en": "snacks" }, "w": 2, "v": 3 }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "expected": [7, 46, 9],
  "solution": ["a = add(view.upk, facts.value)", "m = mmax(view.up, a)", "cell <- m"],
  "debrief": {
    "title": { "zh": "0/1 背包", "en": "0/1 knapsack" },
    "body": [
      {
        "zh": "每件物品只有两种命运：不拿（看正上方），或者拿（去上一行腾出它的重量，再加上它的价值），两者取较大。",
        "en": "Each item has only two fates: left out (look right above), or taken (make room for its weight on the row above, then add its value). Take the larger of the two."
      },
      {
        "zh": "来路必须从<b>上一行</b>出发。上一行还没考虑过这件物品，从那里拿，才能保证它只被拿一次。",
        "en": "The way in must start from <b>the row above</b>. The row above hasn’t considered this item yet, so taking it from there guarantees it is taken only once."
      },
      {
        "zh": "这个问题叫 <wiki-ref to=\"knap01\"></wiki-ref>。选课、做预算、装货柜、给服务器分配任务，背后都是它。",
        "en": "This problem is called the <wiki-ref to=\"knap01\"></wiki-ref>. Choosing courses, budgeting, loading shipping containers and assigning jobs to servers all come down to it."
      }
    ],
    "note": {
      "zh": "0/1 背包：不拿看正上方；拿就从上一行腾出重量，再加价值。",
      "en": "0/1 knapsack: leave it out, look right above; take it, make room for its weight on the row above and add its value."
    }
  }
}
